{"addedOn":10,"avgRating":["fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o"],"breadcrumbsHtml":"<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117\">OpenEdge Development: ABL Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/ABL-Syntax-Reference.html\">ABL Syntax Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<span class=\"active\">GET-UNSIGNED-LONG function</span>\n","class":"manual","created":1470,"dislikeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/dislike/309731","html":"<article class=\"hascomments\" data-page=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/GET-UNSIGNED-LONG-function.html\" id=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/GET-UNSIGNED-LONG-function.html\"><main role=\"main\"><article aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\" class=\"dita\" id=\"GET-UNSIGNED-LONG-function\" role=\"article\">\n  <h1 class=\"title topictitle1 reference\" id=\"ariaid-title1\">GET-UNSIGNED-LONG function</h1>\n  \n  <div class=\"body refbody\">\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"GET-UNSIGNED-LONG-function__section_N1003A_N10037_N10001\">\n      <p class=\"p\">Returns the unsigned 32-bit value at the specified memory\nlocation as an INT64. This is analogous to the GET-UNSIGNED-SHORT\nfunction, except with a 32-bit value. </p>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"GET-UNSIGNED-LONG-function__syntax_GC18OM2693997\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d101419e108\">Syntax</h2>\n      \n      <table class=\"table frame-all\" id=\"GET-UNSIGNED-LONG-function__idGDL2IT2671291\"><caption></caption><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"tbody\">\n            <tr class=\"row rowsep-0\">\n              <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\">\n                <pre class=\"pre codeblock\"><code>GET-UNSIGNED-LONG ( <var class=\"keyword varname\">source</var> , <var class=\"keyword varname\">position</var> )</code></pre>\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody></table>\n      <dl class=\"dl parml\">\n        \n          <dt class=\"dt pt dlterm\">\n            <var class=\"keyword varname\">source</var>\n          </dt>\n          <dd class=\"dd pd\">A function or variable that returns a RAW or MEMPTR value. If <var class=\"keyword varname\">source</var> is\nthe Unknown value (<code class=\"ph codeph\">?</code>), GET-UNSIGNED-LONG returns the Unknown value (<code class=\"ph codeph\">?</code>).</dd>\n        \n        \n          <dt class=\"dt pt dlterm\">\n            <var class=\"keyword varname\">position</var>\n          </dt>\n          <dd class=\"dd pd\">An INTEGER or INT64 value greater than 0 that indicates the\nbyte position where you want to find the information. If <var class=\"keyword varname\">position</var> is\ngreater than the length of <var class=\"keyword varname\">source</var>, the AVM returns\nthe Unknown value (<code class=\"ph codeph\">?</code>). If <var class=\"keyword varname\">position</var> is\nless than 1, the AVM generates a run-time error.</dd>\n        \n      </dl>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"GET-UNSIGNED-LONG-function__notes_GC18ON2694013\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d101419e188\">Notes</h2>\n      \n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n        <li class=\"li\">When\nreturning the value from GET-UNSIGNED-LONG() to an INTEGER, if the\nvalue exceeds the maximum value of an INTEGER, the AVM generates\na run-time error.</li>\n        <li class=\"li\">This function supports byte-swapping only if <var class=\"keyword varname\">source</var> is\na MEMPTR data type. The function will first examine the byte-order\nsetting of the MEMPTR and then swap the bytes appropriately before\ninterpreting them. The AVM does not swap the bytes in the MEMPTR&#39;s\nmemory, but does the byte-swap as it creates the return value.</li>\n        <li class=\"li\">For more information on using the MEMPTR and RAW data types, see <cite class=\"cite\">OpenEdge\nDevelopment: Programming Interfaces</cite>.</li>\n      </ul>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"GET-UNSIGNED-LONG-function__see-also_GC18OO2694021\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d101419e212\">See also</h2>\n      \n      <p class=\"p\">\n        <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"LENGTH-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/LENGTH-function.html\">LENGTH function</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"PUT-UNSIGNED-LONG-statement.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/PUT-UNSIGNED-LONG-statement.html\">PUT-UNSIGNED-LONG statement</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"RAW-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/RAW-function.html\">RAW function</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"RAW-statement.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/RAW-statement.html\">RAW statement</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"SET-SIZE-statement.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/SET-SIZE-statement.html\">SET-SIZE statement</a></p>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n<nav role=\"navigation\"><div class=\"familylinks\"><div class=\"previouslink\"><strong>Previous topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"GET-STRING-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/GET-STRING-function.html\">GET-STRING function</a></div><div class=\"nextlink\"><strong>Next topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"GET-UNSIGNED-SHORT-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/GET-UNSIGNED-SHORT-function.html\">GET-UNSIGNED-SHORT function</a></div></div></nav><nav class=\"related-links\" role=\"navigation\"></nav></article></main></article>\n","isWatched":false,"labelText":"Product; Product > OpenEdge; Product > OpenEdge > Version 11.7; Format; Format > Documentation","likes":0,"likeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/like/309731","myDocsURL":null,"numOfPageViews":0,"numOfRatingsText":"<span>0 Ratings","revised":1318,"showWatch":false,"topicMeta":[["bookowner","oe11docs"],["bookrights","oe11docs"],["bundle","openedge-abl-reference-117"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge/product_openedge_117"],["data","OEInformationHub/format"],["data","OEInformationHub/format/format_documentation"],["organization","oe11docs"]],"topicTitle":"GET-UNSIGNED-LONG function","topicurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/GET-UNSIGNED-LONG-function.html","type":"Manual"}